  Description:

    The TMHDSPZ055ABA is a synchronous high-density single-port SRAM compiler.
    It's based on ICSprout 55nm Logic Low Leakage Process. It can generate the memory instance
    by the different words and bits configuration. It supports the mux
    ratio to meet the different aspect ratio and timing request.
    Word write and bit write are be supports both in the operation and 
    simulation models.
    The TMHDSPZ055ABA includes Verilog behavioral models, Liberty timing models,
    LEF, and CPF.
    

  Symbol

                                        |
                              __________|___________
                             |         CLK          |
                             |                      |
                             |                      |
                          ---|A                     |
                          ---|CEB                   |
                          ---|D                     |
                          ---|GWEB                  |
                             |                     Q|---
                          ---|MAR                   |
                          ---|MARE                  |
                             |                      |
                             |                      |
                             |______________________|


  Features:

    - Margin adjustment option to speed/yield optimization
    - Support power gating mode to further leakage control
    - Provide column redundancy unit for column repair function
    - Fully customized and optimized layout to get minimum area
    - Multi column mux option for area and speed optimization
    - Bit write or word write operation available
    - Operation voltage at 1.08v ~ 1.32v 
    - SRAM bit cell area: 0.525um^2(pre-shrink)
    - Synchronous read and write operations
    - Supports pure HVT and mainly RVT + HVT and mainly LVT + HVT peripherals
    - Clocked address,chip enable,write enable, data in to memory at clock rising edge
    - With write-through feature
    

