    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
    | TT1P2V85CCTYP   | TT      | 1.2        | 85             | 1000        | 
    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
    | FF1P32VM40CCMIN | FF      | 1.32       | -40            | 1000        | 
    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
    | FF1P32V0CCMIN   | FF      | 1.32       | 0              | 1000        | 
    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
    | FF1P32V125CCMIN | FF      | 1.32       | 125            | 1000        | 
    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
    | SS1P08VM40CCMAX | SS      | 1.08       | -40            | 1000        | 
    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
